    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u3092\u3042\u3056\u7B11\u3046\u305F\u3081\u3002\n\u306A\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304B\u2026\u2026\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Was it... to mock us?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3047\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3088\u3002\n\u3088\u304F\u5206\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, that\u0027s right. You figured it out."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3063\u3066\u3001\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u307B\u3057\u3044\u304B\u3089\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306F\n\u305D\u3046\u8A00\u3046\u306E\u3088\u306D\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Is that what you wanted me to say?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u6B8B\u5FF5\u306A\u304C\u3089\u4E0D\u6B63\u89E3\u3002\n\u5BC2\u3057\u3044\u308F\u306D\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3046\u98A8\u306B\u601D\u3046\u306A\u3093\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But unfortunately, that\u0027s incorrect. It makes me sad that you\u0027d think that way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3093\u3089\u304B\u306E\u76EE\u7684\u306E\u305F\u3081",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "For some purpose"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F55\u304B\u3057\u3089\u306E\u76EE\u7684\u304C\u3042\u3063\u3066\u2026\u2026\u3068\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe... for some kind of purpose?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3058\u3083\u3042\u305D\u306E\u4F55\u304B\u3057\u3089\u3092\u6559\u3048\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u304B\u3057\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then can you tell me what that purpose might be?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3063\u3068\u3001\u305D\u308C\u306F\u2026\u2026\u305D\u306E\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um, well... that\u0027s..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u69D8\u5B50\u3058\u3083\u898B\u5F53\u3082\u3064\u304B\u306A\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306D\u3002\n\u6B8B\u5FF5\u3060\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It seems you don\u0027t have any idea. How disappointing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3046\u3045\u2026\u2026\u5FC3\u3092\u8AAD\u307E\u308C\u305F\u308F\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Ugh... she saw right through me...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u306E\u672A\u6765\u3092\u9858\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "For our future"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u306E\u672A\u6765\u304C\u3044\u3044\u672A\u6765\u306B\u306A\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u2026\u2026\n\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Was it... for our future? To ensure we\u0027d have a good future...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3075\u3075\u3001\u305D\u3046\u601D\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u306E\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hehe, so that\u0027s what you think."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306A\u305F\u305F\u3061\u3092\u88CF\u5207\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306A\u3053\u3068\u3092\u3057\u305F\u306E\u306B\u3001\n\u305D\u308C\u3067\u3082\u79C1\u3092\u4FE1\u3058\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even though I betrayed you all, you still believe in me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u601D\u3044\u8FD4\u3055\u306A\u304D\u3083\u3002\n\u3000\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306F\u3069\u3093\u306A\u4EBA\u3060\u3063\u305F\u306E\u304B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I need to remember... What kind of person was Saskia?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u5927\u6383\u9664\u306E\u6642\u3001\u3082\u306E\u3092\u5927\u5207\u306B\u3057\u3066\u3044\u3066\n\u3000\u305C\u3093\u305C\u3093\u6368\u3066\u3089\u308C\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(During the big cleanup, she couldn\u0027t throw anything away because she treasured everything so much...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u9762\u5012\u304F\u3055\u304C\u308A\u306A\u306E\u306B\u3001\u932C\u91D1\u515A\u3068\u306E\u6C7A\u6226\u524D\u306B\n\u3000\u307F\u3093\u306A\u306B\u304A\u5B88\u308A\u3092\u914D\u3063\u305F\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Even though she usually hates doing troublesome things, she gave everyone charms before the battle with the Alchemy Faction...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u5148\u751F\u3068\u540C\u3058\u3088\u3046\u306A\u307E\u306A\u3056\u3057\u3092\u6301\u3063\u305F\u3001\n\u3000\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Saskia, who had the same kind of gaze as our teacher...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u3001\u8AB0\u304B\u3092\u8CB6\u3081\u3088\u3046\u3068\u3059\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306A\n\u3000\u4EBA\u306B\u306F\u601D\u3048\u306A\u3044\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(She just doesn\u0027t seem like someone who would try to hurt others...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u304D\u3063\u3068\u305D\u306E\u884C\u52D5\u306B\u306F\u3001\u306A\u3093\u3089\u304B\u306E\n\u3000\u610F\u5473\u304C\u3042\u308B\u2026\u2026\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(There must be some meaning behind her actions...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u3002\u78BA\u304B\u306B\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306F\n\u3068\u3093\u3067\u3082\u306A\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3092\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia. What you did was terrible."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3042\u305F\u3057\u306F\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u3053\u308C\u3060\u3051\u306F\n\u4FE1\u3058\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306B\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But there\u0027s one thing about you that I\u0027ve decided to believe in."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u4F55\u3092\u4FE1\u3058\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...What do you believe in?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2\u2462",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Choice 3"
        }
